   relevant to the scholarly discussion of Late Bronze Age Aegean seals and the 
   Ring of Nestor. [4][12][13]                                                  
 • Pini’s article "The ‘Ring of Nestor’" is cited as published in the Oxford    
   Journal of Archaeology, volume 17 (1998), issue 1, on pages 1–13. [4][11]    

Journal of Hellenic Studies "The Ring of Nestor" Thisbe Boeotia article details 

